<title>USA: PVF Capital Corp Q3 March 31 net increases.</title>
<headline>PVF Capital Corp Q3 March 31 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>						March 31,   March 31,</p>
<p>					1997    1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Interest income		$7,733  $6,770  $22,932   $20,544</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses     107	23	107	 417</p>
<p> Net income			1,222     933     2,392    2,603</p>
<p>Per share earnings on</p>
<p>   common stock		   0.49    0.37     0.96	1.05</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for the first nine months of 1997 includes a one-time charge of $1,708,000 for recapitalization of SAIF insurance fund.</p>
<p>(Dollars in thousands except per share data)</p>
</text>
